DESCRIPTION:I grew up in Manhattan among the elite\, and now I've become an
  anthropologist of my own tribe\, examining the absurdity of wealth. My new
  hour of stand-up is full of Gossip Girl and Succession characters – expl
 oring why money is the one thing nobody wants to talk about honestly. Part 
 confessional\, part hilarious sendup of the 1%. Directed by Eddie Ewing.\nM
